{{Quote|Allows the user to turn into a Tiger, granting enhanced agility and powerful melee attacks.|Shop}}
'''Tiger''' (formerly known as [[Leopard]]) is a {{Mythical}} [[Beast]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|5,000,000}} or {{Robux|3,000}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Tiger allows the user to acquire powerful and quick-paced attacks, as well as to transform into an anthropomorphic {{w|tiger}}, granting them speed, agility, and offense. 

